### Event Tracking API

### 1. Track Event (unauthenticated)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events/track
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventName": "page_view",
  "eventGroup": "miniprogram",
  "metadata": {
    "page": "/pages/index/index",
    "source": "app_launch"
  }
}

### 2. Track Event (authenticated)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events/track
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventName": "practice_room_create",
  "eventGroup": "practice",
  "metadata": {
    "playerCount": 6,
    "blindLevel": "50/100"
  }
}

### 3. Admin List Events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?take=20
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### 4. Admin List Events by Group
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?eventGroup=practice&take=20
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
